mintcare (1.12.8) noble; urgency=medium

  * Appearance: a colour-blind friendly theme (blue, orange and vermilion for
    health, warnings and problems).
  * Keyboard focus is outlined in every theme.
  * Accessibility: every button, combo box, spin button and text box has a
    name for screen readers; the navigation scrollbar stays visible.
  * Storage temperature range over the last week; cache growth on the
    cleaning page; monthly summary; Ethernet link speed; thumbnails for
    picture duplicates.
  * Power history chart where the machine reports power.
  * Support bundle includes warnings and errors from this start-up.

